      "text": "Alibaba Cloud\u2019s July 2025 engine-parameter release notes list exposure of timeseriesSideBucketCatalogMemoryUsageThreshold for its MongoDB 8.0 service; this is a managed-service availability date, not evidence that upstream MongoDB introduced the mechanism in July 2025. (low confidence)",
