    },
    {
      "id": "clm:9056157a9ee9676d5b521513180e483895f24caf0de831e928cd9b3208cf2910",
      "text": "The parameter defines when idle-bucket expiry begins; treating it as a guaranteed ceiling on total mongod memory is unsupported by these interfaces and the regression test. (medium confidence)",
