        "https://help.aliyun.com/en/mongodb/user-guide/parameters-available-in-mongodb-8-0"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9709419c93ed4e7b485721779c8be9a89f3b508b0264333cc244932bd7110737",
        "ev:ce90907efba077da735699fb850ffaeaecae78dcf0b22d3011352a0a64caad74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:5c644f6056cd0714a20e572958d0c9d2c571f1d5fc10eeff43885df4b500bba8",
      "text": "At MongoDB commit 35647d07, timeseriesSideBucketCatalogMemoryUsageThreshold is expressed in bytes and defaults to 104857600 bytes (100 MiB); the ApsaraDB MongoDB 8.0 parameter table independently lists the same numeric default. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/35647d07bc4bc11966c90fe7100eb1db0b0ac1d9/src/mongo/db/timeseries/timeseries.idl",
      "also": [
        "https://help.aliyun.com/en/mongodb/user-guide/parameters-available-in-mongodb-8-0"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9709419c93ed4e7b485721779c8be9a89f3b508b0264333cc244932bd7110737",
        "ev:ce90907efba077da735699fb850ffaeaecae78dcf0b22d3011352a0a64caad74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:c24f3473d0e45cdf21d62dd1b8c4c65189ec666d9033384cecf29cee2a010440",
      "text": "The pinned parameter definition allows startup and runtime configuration. MongoDB\u2019s regression test at revision 46e8db22 exercises both configuration modes. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/35647d07bc4bc11966c90fe7100eb1db0b0ac1d9/src/mongo/db/timeseries/timeseries.idl",
