    },
    {
      "id": "clm:cccfb77892497a67b6aeafba81c238f23a99ea9300cc6c37de5e891a1b456649",
      "text": "The side catalog has a separate idle-bucket-expiry memory threshold, timeseriesSideBucketCatalogMemoryUsageThreshold; the regression test isolates it by configuring 1 MiB for the side catalog and 100 MiB for the main catalog. (high confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/35647d07bc4bc11966c90fe7100eb1db0b0ac1d9/src/mongo/db/timeseries/timeseries.idl",
      "also": [
        "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/46e8db22d75751f6469d95f87a5ad700f51264d6/jstests/noPassthrough/timeseries/timeseries_side_bucket_catalog_memory_usage_threshold.js"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:9709419c93ed4e7b485721779c8be9a89f3b508b0264333cc244932bd7110737",
        "ev:aa344f7b983f79cdc5e53040f3c84e4e1f1ccea82680bad59d049901be27c0a2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:4afe3d106499f3934f13b45dfab75c4742b8c4d17e7f0fdeb84986e7a92846ff",
      "text": "The regression test at revision 46e8db22 expects numBucketsArchivedDueToMemoryThreshold to increase after it induces side-catalog memory pressure; its comments allow subsequent closure if archival does not reclaim enough memory, and it checks that memory-triggered closures do not outnumber memory-triggered archivals. (low confidence)",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/46e8db22d75751f6469d95f87a5ad700f51264d6/jstests/noPassthrough/timeseries/timeseries_side_bucket_catalog_memory_usage_threshold.js",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:aafd84d66af2a814ac68f219a2eb3ceec30acad579941109ce3ddfae6f19ae36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:6d3a27f41b7ff58243adc839b4ae5b8110d6cf13ef407f95fb882aa7baef2f99",
      "text": "The BucketCatalog header provides getSideBucketCatalogCollectionStats and documents that it assumes statistics for one collection; it also declares mergeExecutionStatsToBucketCatalog for merging collection execution statistics. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-24)",
